{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今屆港姐決賽大玩科技感，大會今日（29日）率先發布一系列由AI技術打造的舞台視覺照，震撼網民眼球！12位候選佳麗在CG、Motion Graphics及AI視覺技術的加持下，分別化身成與12款「吉祥神獸」合一的奇幻角色，造型百變，場面極具衝擊力，究竟決賽當晚的舞台效果會有多震撼？</p><p>美國得獎團隊操刀 AI打造沉浸式奇幻舞台</p><p>今屆港姐決賽舞台再次由屢獲美國紐約電視大獎金獎的製作團隊Creative Imaging Department（CID）匠心打造，綜合運用CG、Motion Graphics及AI視覺技術，營造沉浸式舞台影像體驗。製作團隊以佳麗的硬照為基礎，再運用AI延展視覺，配合後期製作、CG視覺與Motion Graphics設計，構築出一個個奇幻華麗、富層次感的Video Wall，務求為觀眾呈現最震撼的視覺效果。</p><p>12佳麗配對專屬神獸 奇幻仙子暗黑Look曝光</p><p>在率先曝光的「神獸」系列中，12位佳麗包括1號袁絲珩、2號李澤欣、3號李澄晴、4號譚雅文、5號魏欣、6號盧蔚晴、7號楊媛媛、8號鄧匡閔、9號周芳姿、10號陳梓穎、11號顏懿菲及12號湯家琳，分別與飛鷹、母獅、海豚、豺狼、聖伯納犬、白馬、大象、鯨魚、白貓、灰鴨、鹿仔及白兔等12款「吉祥神獸」配對。佳麗們現身於草原、樹林、海洋等不同場景，造型更是各有千秋，當中既有華麗晚裝Look，亦有奇幻仙子Look、暗黑Look、未來感十足的女戰士Look，以及可愛佻皮Look，風格多變，令人目不暇給。</p><p>網民大讚有心思：今年舞台效果好屈機</p><p>這輯充滿未來感和奇幻色彩的造型照一出，網民反應相當熱烈，紛紛大讚製作有心思。有網民留言：「今年個台好有誠意，唔再係傳統選美！」、「AI加CG效果好癲，期待決賽晚嘅完整畫面！」、「TVB個製作團隊原來咁勁，有驚喜！」、「女戰士look好型！想睇多啲！」、「有啲似打機啲角色，好有新鮮感！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_17354380856a92d0e6e99b8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_12786929006a92d0e8e7f04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_14609392646a92d0ebc005d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_3139400266a92d0ef8774b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_2695339506a92d0f39e663.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_3681387466a92d0f71ef3b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_6509056656a92d0fa744cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_5398464216a92d0fd8216d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_6286351876a92d100c18db.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_11632046096a92d1038f49b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_5888194966a92d1075e6bf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_10025528436a92d10a46047.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_15417624536a92d10e2a702.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_13270838016a92d110d4310.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_8562114676a92d1142481d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_14609778226a92d11767b7d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_20865835586a92d11ac1c4a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19a_3723379716a92d11d6f025.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_1815650006a92d12070ff3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_10205024326a92d12366859.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_17776858106a92d1261ed41.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_4051418516a92d128c7d87.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_9162085326a92d12baab60.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:38:14.377216+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1058,"images":23,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}